            "answer": {
              "short": "$10$. Subtract the squares: $160-150$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(4\\sqrt{10}-5\\sqrt{6})(4\\sqrt{10}+5\\sqrt{6})&=(4\\sqrt{10})^2-(5\\sqrt{6})^2\\\\&=160-150\\\\&=10\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
